    "notes": "No audio, no amounts on screen: all quantities are guesses. Uses ready fermented dosa batter (not made in the video). The green paste (coriander, curry leaves, ginger, green chillies) is only poured in, made off-screen, so I assumed grinding the four listed items with a little water; the four paste ingredients share one thumbnail. Hing is only a tiny pinch in the frame (no thumbnail). Ragi tagged as 'millet'."
